`GzL`: the form `κ(x_a, x_b)` of `singular_cert/cert_E7.json` (sparse rows); `Gi2L`: twice its inverse.
`opp`, `pickI`: the opposite root and a simple root not orthogonal to it.  `formPairOK a c` packages the
facts used to compute the Killing form on the cert basis by invariance (`E7LieKilling`).
